---
<ProductLayout title={page.title} hreflang={hreflang} description={page.description} canonical={page.canonical} ogImage="/images/Instant-Sweet-Potatoes-Flakes-2.jpg" gallery={gallery} category={category} price={price} related={related} descriptionHtml={`<h2>Instant Sweet Potatoes Flakes</h2><p><strong>(Purple Sweet Potato Snowflake Flakes)</strong></p><h3><strong>Product Overview:</strong></h3><p>Our <em>Instant Sweet Potatoes Flakes</em> are made from carefully selected purple sweet potatoes using advanced low-temperature drum-drying technology. This process preserves the natural color, aroma, and nutritional content of the sweet potatoes, resulting in a high-quality, ready-to-use flake product with excellent solubility and minimal sweetness.</p><hr/><h3><img alt="Instant Sweet Potatoes Flakes" height="554" src="/images/Instant-Sweet-Potatoes-Flakes-300x300.png" width="554"/></h3><h3><strong>【Processing Flow】</strong></h3><p>Fresh Purple Sweet Potatoes → Washing &amp; Peeling → Steaming → Mashing → Drum Drying (Low-Temperature) → Flaking → Sieving → Metal Detection → Packaging</p><hr/><h3><strong>【Industrial Applications】</strong></h3><p>Widely used in:</p><ul><li><strong>Bakery</strong> (cakes, bread, cookies)</li><li><strong>Pasta and noodles</strong></li><li><strong>Dumplings and steamed buns</strong></li><li><strong>Desserts and snacks</strong></li></ul><p>Its fine texture, vivid purple color, and low sweetness make it ideal for natural coloring and nutrient enrichment in industrial food processing.</p><hr/><h3><strong>【Product Specifications (China GB Standard Reference)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Moisture</strong>: ≤ 8%</li><li><strong>Ash</strong>: ≤ 5%</li><li><strong>Mesh Size</strong>: 60–100 mesh</li><li><strong>Solubility</strong>: ≥ 98%</li><li><strong>Color</strong>: Natural purple</li><li><strong>Additives</strong>: None (no added sugar, colorants, or preservatives)</li><li><strong>Sweetness</strong>: Naturally mild, no additional sugar</li></ul><hr/><h3><strong>【Brewing Instructions】</strong></h3><p>Dissolve in <strong>hot or cold water</strong>.<br/>Excellent solubility – ready in seconds.<br/>No extra sugar added – suitable for low-sugar formulations or dietary products.</p><hr/><h3><strong>【Storage Method】</strong></h3><p>Store at room temperature in a <strong>cool, dry, and ventilated place</strong>, away from direct sunlight and moisture.</p><hr/><h3><strong>【Product Origin】</strong></h3><p>Wangheng Economic Development Zone, Xinghua City, Jiangsu Province, China</p>`} />
